sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Database failover changes the endpoint target
accDescr: A failed primary is replaced by the synchronous standby, and the application reconnects through the existing database endpoint.
participant App as Multi-AZ web tier
participant DNS as RDS endpoint
participant P as Primary in AZ A
participant S as Standby in AZ B
App->>DNS: Resolve database endpoint
DNS-->>App: Primary address
App->>P: Database request
P->>S: Synchronous replication
Note over P: Primary or AZ fails
Note over S: RDS promotes standby
Note over DNS: Endpoint target is updated
App->>DNS: Reconnect and resolve endpoint
DNS-->>App: New primary address
App->>S: Retry database request
